# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context.
# Without this file gcloud derives one from .gitignore, which also drops
# public/frames/ — harmless today, but the frontend build COPYs public/, so
# this file keeps the upload rules explicit instead of inherited.
.git
.github
.claude
.codex
.agents
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
graphify-out
e2e
*.log
.env
**/.env
